l\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/app-tracking-transaprency-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"app-tracking-transaprency\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[]},{\"id\":17055,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-rc-indizi-nuovi-prodotti-apple\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.7 RC svela indizi su oltre 10 nuovi prodotti Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel codice di macOS 26.7 Release Candidate compaiono riferimenti a AirPods con fotocamera a infrarossi, iPhone pieghevole, un nuovo hub smart home, MacBook e iPad mini con OLED e un Siri Remote aggiornato per Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[]},{\"id\":17053,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-lancio-rimandato-al-2027-nonostante-il-video-demo\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: lancio rimandato al 2027 nonostante il video demo\",\"excerpt\":\"Le AirPods con fotocamere non arriveranno nel 2026: Apple le avrebbe pianificate per il 2027, dopo problemi di supply chain e software. Le immagini demo non cambiano i tempi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-pro-3-peach-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-peach\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[]},{\"id\":17051,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"codice-macos-nuova-casa-apple-homepad-homepod-mini-2-videocamera\",\"title\":\"Il codice di macOS svela 